#: c7a667019ca742399493002ea51c30f6
msgid "SERIAL8 = USER = UART8"
msgstr "SERIAL8 = 用户 = UART8"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:84
#: 0814e01690f74361a23f2fbf7bfb32a3
msgid ""
"Serial port protocols (Telem, GPS, etc.) can be adjusted to personal "
"preferences."
msgstr "串口协议（数传、GPS 等）可根据个人偏好调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:87
#: cef26cf6925e4db3acc6cdaa83750db4
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:88
#: 56e76a327abd4bd8846f4effb8da825f
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R1 (UART1_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a "
"specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` is set to "
"\"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R1（UART1_RX）引脚上。支持除 PPM 以外的所有 RC 协议。详情参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。:ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为 「23」 以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:90
#: 3c6b3387da0b4629831dce469124706f
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R1 pin but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接 R1 引脚，但 SBUS 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为 「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:92
#: f4f3c67b00364553a4df87227c9cca10
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接至 T6，并将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:94
#: e9c6523aff204258ad380ff53448e03e
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to R1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R1 外还需连接 T1，并自动提供数传数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:96
#: 21e7f2066736449482674931923cb2dc
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接 T1 并自动提供数传数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:98
#: a3c2c52f9ec241f48ed6c04f6c8e0a26
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:101
#: d312d853287b492a997e9d56978720e8
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:103
#: df1a34ccdb314dd59a59c39aba60057b
msgid ""
"The SPracing H7 Extreme onboard OSD is used by setting "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr ""
"SPracing H7 Extreme 板载 OSD 通过设置 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 为 1（MAX7456 驱动）启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:106
#: 14deb8bda0144762ba592f779c922bd0
msgid "SmartPort Telemetry"
msgstr "SmartPort 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:108
#: a09ab37d47f849d79df1d843466f38ac
msgid ""
"SmartPort (Sport) telemetry setup by default to be connected directly to "
"UART2 TX pin with no external inverters required."
msgstr "SmartPort（Sport）数传默认设置为直接连接到 UART2 TX 引脚，无需外部反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:111
#: 0380fb31899b40a2a4027a1d4e1d1c61
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:113
#: 23e9af94825e4af6a0e195d0a9951195
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are DShot and PWM capable. Motor outputs 1-4 are bi-"
"directional DShot capable. However, mixing DShot and normal PWM operation "
"for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling DShot for an output in a"
" group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as "
"DShot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups that must be the same (PWM"
" rate or DShot, when configured as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1-4, "
"5/6, 7/8, 9/10."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。电机输出 1–4 支持双向 DShot。但是，混用 DShot 与普通 PWM "
"输出受组限制，即为某组中的某路输出启用 DShot，则该组所有输出都必须配置并用作 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须使用相同模式（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1–4、5/6、7/8、9/10。"

