#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:132
#: 8ff2ba87c8334bb7b45b4fed5f1ccfb8
msgid "RSSI Input"
msgstr "RSSI 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:134
#: 74ed84b7159644ab81ce7153b2ae34b6
msgid ""
"Analog or PWM RSSI Input can be attached to the RSSI pin. Set "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 0. adjust other RSSI parameters as "
"needed, see :ref:`common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication`."
msgstr ""
"模拟或 PWM RSSI 输入可连接到 RSSI 引脚。设置 :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = "
"0，并根据需要调整其他 RSSI 参数，参见 :ref:`common-rssi-received-signal-strength-"
"indication`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:137
#: cfc5dec9fed04a0980ec128d719cba99
msgid "NeoPixel LED"
msgstr "NeoPixel LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:139
#: 7edf699d25d946fa9d594ed51d8d3e68
msgid "The LED output is setup for use with NeoPixel LEDs by default."
msgstr "LED 输出默认设置用于 NeoPixel LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:142
#: d9ddbca341f34e468f01dc11822bda28
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:144
#: c88a2f44b0bb428da2af64a08753bd4e
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"SPracingH7\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的子文件夹 「SPracingH7」 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:147
#: 7c695e3169464610a478f9f80e82499f
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:149
#: 392460bf62884ad3bfb088f70c255ce0
msgid ""
"Since this board stores the flight control software on external flash the "
"initial firmware load should be done using the `SPRacing SSBL "
"<https://github.com/spracing/ssbl>`__ . Please follow the instructions for "
"loading PX4 firmware to load ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"由于此板将飞控软件存储在外部闪存上，初始固件加载应使用 `SPRacing SSBL "
"<https://github.com/spracing/ssbl>`__。请参照加载 PX4 固件的说明来加载 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:151
#: f7c04caed59a4df5a31725b517250355
msgid ""
"A `convenient script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/ssbl_uploader.sh>`__"
" is also available to perform the required steps."
msgstr ""
"也可使用 `便捷脚本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/scripts/ssbl_uploader.sh>`__"
" 执行所需步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spracingh7-extreme.rst:153
#: b4bca5190f7c4ea6a0df35728a25f5b6
msgid ""
"It should also be possible to load the ArduPilot firmware and bootloader via"
" DFU <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards>`__ , but doing so "
"will invalidate your warranty."
msgstr ""
"也可通过 DFU 加载 ArduPilot 固件和引导程序 <common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-"
"boards>`__，但此操作将使保修失效。"
